OL,3,APrepare for supply chain disruption
OL,4,Afrom cyber or climate emergencies,
OL,5,AStreeting warns
OL,6,
OL,7,FMembers of the public and businesses
OL,8,Fneed to think more about how they would
OL,9,Fcope with natural disasters,
OL,10,Fcyber-attacks or state-sponsored
OL,11,Fterrorism, the defence secretary has
OL,12,Fsaid.
OL,14,FWes Streeting warned people needed to
OL,15,Fbe more aware of emerging risks facing
OL,16,Fthe UK and make plans to deal with
OL,17,Fthem.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
